-- Founding Community batch fm-2026-10: CUT THE EXAMPLE CAST from 136 to 29 accounts
-- (9 mentors + 20 apprentices). Generated by seed/scripts/reduce_cast.py; do not edit by hand.
-- Removes 107 example accounts with everything they wrote, 109 threads, 763 replies (+17 kept-author replies that only made
-- sense after a removed one), 27 mentorships, 294 follows, 9 collabs and the pitches of removed apprentices;
-- repairs 37 reply bodies and 6 thread bodies, 5 accepted flags and 3 helpful counts (as deltas, so real votes are kept);
-- adds 10 mentorships (+1 pending -> active), 16 follows and 8 pitches (3 existing pitches change status).
-- One transaction, homefixr.seeding = 'on' (nothing notifies). It:
--   * aborts unless the batch is exactly in its live state (136 profiles with the expected ids and handles, 213 posts,
--     1,224 replies, 36 mentorships, 389 follows, 20 collabs, 61 pitches, and the rows it edits still hold the seeded text);
--   * aborts if any real (non-seeded) member's post, reply, message, mentorship or collab application would be deleted;
--   * REPORTS (does not block) real follows of removed accounts and real helpful votes on removed content: both are dropped;
--   * aborts if the batch has already been cut (29 profiles), so a second run changes nothing.
